   (ICESD), Singapore, SINGAPORE, FEB 19-21, 2014},
Abstract = {One-way water supply systems which do not take into consideration the
   required demand are becoming an issue in terms of their efficient use of
   water. In this study, a demand prediction simulator was developed used
   to present the measures for increasing the water reuse ratio and
   reducing energy consumption. For its development, by using a multi-layer
   perception (MLP), a demand prediction module was developed, and an
   operating simulation module for the supply facilities of multiple water
   resources were implemented. (C) 2014 Published by Elsevier B.V.},
