   and identify perceived opportunities and barriers to using a Web portal
   to optimize its use. The perceptions of 30 tuberculosis patients and 18
   doctors (10 general practitioners and 8 TB specialists) from Tomsk,
   Russia were collected through semi-structured interviews. The responses
