   AFRICA, NOV 10-11, 2014},
Abstract = {The purpose of this study is to develop an understanding in the use of
   mobile devices in administering telemedicine services within the public
   health care sector of South Africa. An online questionnaire was
   developed and distributed amongst medical officers, specialists,
   students and medical staff of one of the health districts of South
   Africa. This paper describes the design of the questionnaire as well as
   the most significant outcomes. Results are presented in terms of reasons
   why healthcare workers use mobile devices, as well as perceptions in
   terms of transmission security and quality of transmitted information.},
