   (IFEESM), Shenzhen, PEOPLES R CHINA, SEP 25-26, 2015},
Abstract = {By importing the meteorological data of water temperatures to TRNSYS
   software, temperature differential control method was applied to
   simulate hybrid ground source heat pump system for three months in
   Wuhan. In order to obtain running effect of this system, the inlet and
   outlet water temperatures of heat pump and buried pipe, as well as the
   soil temperature change trend and the COP of this system were
   investigated respectively. The results show that this system is running
   well under given conditions and it provides reference for the operation
   of hybrid ground source heat pump system.},
