   Agr Univ Wageningen, Dept Soil Sci, NL-6700 AA Wageningen, Netherlands.
   Hungarian Acad Sci, Res Inst Soil Sci \& Agr Chem, Budapest, Hungary.
   Int Soil Reference \& Informat Ctr, Wageningen, Netherlands.},
