   German Acad Exchange Serv Fdn; IMRE Alumni Network},
Abstract = {With the deepening of corporate social responsibility (CSR), corporate
   hypocrisy caused attentions of many scholars, business managers and even
   the public. At present, under the background of corporate social
   responsibility, the definition of CSR and hypocrisy is still at the
   initial stage. Based on the meaning of corporate social responsibility
   and hypocrisy in management and psychology, this paper constructs the
   evaluation system model based on product, social news, advertisement and
   information disclosure from the perspective of consumer perception, and
