Abstract = {With the proliferation of mobile device types and variety of tasks being
   performed on those devices, it is necessary to examine how this pairing
   changes with individuals. NeuroIS offers complementary tools to
   traditional survey tools helping researchers delve into users'
   perceptions while they are engaged in different tasks. Through analysis
