   Press},
Abstract = {From the perspective of the customer value theory, this paper researches
   teaching problems and the countermeasures of the English Teaching
   Methodology. It establishes the teaching quality gap figure, from which
   it can be found that students' values and demands should be emphasized
   on combining teaching theory into practical and observable activities,
   turning. their knowledge perception into specific teaching activities,
   and integrating the teaching theory into the middle school English
   teaching practice so that the quality of English Teaching Methodology
   and students' satisfaction may be improved by these methods.},
