Abstract = {Tourist psychological capacity (TPC) is an important dimension of
   researches on tourism carrying capacity, which plays an important role
   on the sustainable development of the destination by regulating the
   perception of tourist. Studying TPC is very helpful for grasping the
   mental activities of tourists and carrying out management researches. By
   using a method of grounded analysis, this paper carried out three
   factors which affect TPC, i.e. tourist expected value, tourist perceived
   value and tourist added value. According to the three factors, a series
   of suggestions are proposed to improve TPC.},
