Note = {2nd WSEAS Int Conf on Natural Hazards/2nd Int Conf on Climate Changes,
   Global Warming, Biological Programs/2nd Int Conf on Urban Rehabil and
   Sustainabil, Morgan State Univ, Baltimore, MD, NOV 07-09, 2009},
Organization = {WSEAS},
Abstract = {Water resources carrying capacity is used to reflect the supporting
   ability of the water resources system for sustainable society
   development, and it is an important issue in the field of water
   resources research and sustainable development. In practice, water
   resources carrying capacity is a basic theory of local water resources
   exploitation. Therefore, through researching local water resources
   carrying capacity, we can not only understand the supporting function of
   the water resources system for social development, harmonize
   developmental relationships among the population, resources and
   environment but also realize the social sustainable development well.
   The paper expounds the concept of water resources carrying capacity,
   connotation and characteristics deeply, and discusses several main
   evaluation methods of water resources carrying capacity, After analyzing
   the existing problems on the research of the field at present it
   explores the perspectives of water resources carrying capacity.},
