   Univ Trisakti, Fac Landscape Architecture \& Environm Technol, Jakarta,
   INDONESIA, AUG 09-10, 2017},
Abstract = {Several cities in Indonesia have the sewerage local regulation such as
   Banjarmasin, Bantul, Surakarta and Denpasar. Meanwhile, The National
   Government have guideline in composing domestic sewerage regulation.
   Each city have their own characteristic and issues that need to be
   carried out by the local regulation. By using SWOT analysis, this study
   tries to figure out several aspect that need to be included in the local
   regulation. International references from developed and developing
   countries like Japan, Phillipines, Malaysia and Thailand were also used
   as benchmark without neglecting the local conditions of cities in
   Indonesia. Several crucial aspect of local regulation are institutional
   authority, composition on-site and off-site system, tariff, evaluation
   and monitoring, as well as punishment and rewards. Both tariff and
   evaluation aspects need to be narrowed down into specific regulations.},
