Abstract = {This research is prepared to provide a feasible method to find
   complicated relationship between health and comfort of office workers in
   large buildings with HVAC and measured indoor environment parameters.
   Three longitudinal studies were employed to evaluate IEQ changes
   associated with different HVAC systems and operational modes, and
   examine effects of psychosocial factors on occupants. It aimed at causes
   of SBS and indoor environmental perceptions using exposure assessment,
   intervention approaches, and multivariate analysis. The findings of this
   study provide insight to SBS problems and suggest further research
   opportunities for investigating building-related health and comfort
   issues.},
